      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Allright, the pen problems in Presentation world is just crazy.\nI grabbed so many bugged / locked pens and i cannot draw something normal. (pens or pencils)\n\nThis will even happen more times if there are players who steal pens for fun and that causes locked up pens.\n\nI found also out, even pens which are put back on original place, are still locked up! Really useless and very annoying. Only start new world has fresh pens and not more locked up.\n\nAnd my advice for other players: please, don't steal pens if player is still busy with drawing. Because that will cause locked up pen and cannot reset easy. Wait first until other player is done with drawing, then there will less risk on locked up pens.\n\nHopefully VRChat can do something about locked up pens with good reset button or so.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
