  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Oke, this is pretty annoying. Not sure it's a bug, so i will put here a request to make it better.\n\nThe pen bugged a bit when someone steal your pen while drawing. This will cause 'lock up' the pen and will just draw in the air even no trigger is pressed. There is no option to reset the pen immediately or unlock it.\nPerhaps if pen reset itself and go to default position, it might reset.\nIt happen too if other player is too near and grab your pen by accident.\n\nI wish the pen will just act normal even it's stealed from other player, and must not lock itself in drawing mode. It's just useless and annoying. I am forced to get another pen, but there is also chance other pen is also locked...",
